Subject: [PATCH 2/6] pkg/report, sys, tools/syz-symbolize: miscellaneous
 updates for freebsd

for pkg/report and tools/syz-symbolize, update symbolize function to
normalize line ending in call stack.  Update some syscall descriptions
to avoid errors, and update prepareArch() in sys/syz-extract to extract
some constants.
---
